# CIV 2026 data hackathon
#
# Expected stack: Python/uv and notebooks, MCAP/ROS 2 data, Polars/DuckDB/
# Parquet analytics, Streamlit or Panel, optional LangGraph/local models,
# Docker/Podman, DVC, and MLflow/Evidently/OpenTelemetry.
#
# Keep source code, schemas, manifests, dependency lockfiles, Dockerfiles,
# notebooks, and reviewed documentation in Git. Large data and model files
# belong in approved object storage, DVC, or Git LFS instead.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets, credentials, and machine-local configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
.envrc
.direnv/

secrets/
credentials/
private-credentials/
*.secret
*.secrets
*.local
*.local.json
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

.aws/
.azure/
.config/gcloud/
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.dvc/config.local
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.override.yaml

